      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the late 1940s the area had scattered farms, and by 1956 it had several dwellings and a cemetery.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/la-tina-ranch-tx",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 1970 La Tina Ranch had grown to twenty‑eight homes, showing steady development over the decades.",
